Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:11.15,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,So irritating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:15.47,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,He came out of absolutely no where and made a mockery out of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:17.97,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Where do you think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:21.97,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Being friends isn't a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:24.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah! Friends are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:30.10,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,When it comes time, we'll just have to show him how strong our friendship is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:31.98,Default,4,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:33.18,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:37.24,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Even though we're rivals, it's different when it comes to taking down that phantom thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:42.27,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's use our friendship power to hold him and and I'll deliver the final blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:43.66,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:46.85,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Why soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.85,0:00:47.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{Owwwww.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:51.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:54.34,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,24.5?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.33,0:00:58.09,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ah! I just got a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.09,0:01:02.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What do you think about doing a special on PriPara TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:02.85,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:07.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,And it's name will be "24.5 Hour Television"!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.35,0:01:10.40,Default,Rest,0,0,0,,"24.5 Hour Television"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:11.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:15.12,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You've got some big feet there, Shion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:16.07,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:51.04,Default,All,0,0,0,,Friend Tickets Save the World!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:56.00,Default,All,0,0,0,,24.5 Hour Television: Friends Save PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:57.92,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:02:59.79,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Nice festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.79,0:03:02.24,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,This is the stylish tough guy, Mega-nii.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.24,0:03:06.89,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Make sure to keep your eyes focused on me for the entire 24.5 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:11.39,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Additionally, these six are going to attempt to set a big record.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:12.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:16.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We want to snap Friend Tickets with one million people!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.69,0:03:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the 24.5 Hour One Million Friend Ticket Snapping Challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:22.84,Default-Alt,Mana,0,0,0,,Friend Tickets are a symbol of friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:24.45,Default-Alt,Mana,0,0,0,,And we'd like to prove it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:26.91,Default-Alt,Shion,0,0,0,,And we can achieve it with your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:29.62,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,We'd love your assistance-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:32.32,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,This "24.5 Hour Television" sounds interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:34.12,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,I'm going to go snap with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:36.32,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,President Minami is doing her best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:40.38,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Yet, is watching over her like this \Nthe only thing I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:43.02,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,No, that is not all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.02,0:03:45.77,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,I'm going to run 373 kilometres!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.77,0:03:48.30,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,For the passion I have for President Minami in my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.30,0:03:51.72,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Love will save PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.65,0:03:53.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:55.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,There's already this many people here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:57.06,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Don't push or shove!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:59.52,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Don't rush. We'll make sure to snap with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:07.91,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,We'll take the the snapped Friend Tickets,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:11.03,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,and attach them one by one to the side of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:13.22,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Once one million people have come through,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:16.51,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,the friend tickets will create some sort of spectacular miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.51,0:04:17.83,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Please look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.83,0:04:19.34,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Amazing-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:22.63,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,90% of the world population is watching-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:26.88,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,They're also receiving batch after batch of Friend Tickets from around the globe-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:30.34,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,One million's going to be a piece of cake-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:33.57,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Snap with one million people, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:33.63,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,One million Friend Tickets sure is a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.57,0:04:38.13,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,She's still going on about that friendship crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:38.98,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,With everyone's help, I wonder if we'll reach around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:38.98,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:42.69,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,We'll see once I find my next candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.69,0:04:50.15,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Who will be the princess that shall bring a beautiful revolution to PriPara?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:48.38,Default-Alt,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,For our first segment,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.38,0:04:51.16,Default-Alt,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,PriPara's number one pop idol is coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.15,0:04:51.16,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Pop?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.16,0:04:55.12,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,The Let's Apply Pri to the End of Mirei's Sentences Show-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:56.81,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,An idol without a  sentence ender....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:05:01.35,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,...is like oden without chikuwa in it-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.35,0:05:03.70,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri is the world! The world is Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:06.15,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri does not make Pri better than other Pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:09.01,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri of the Pri by the Pri, for the Pri-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.61,0:05:13.27,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,And here is the one who has the troubled sentence ender we'll be consoling today-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:19.85,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,All right, panellists, what sentence ender would you suggest for this troubled PriPara idol-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.81,0:05:22.14,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:25.37,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,"Good morning!" shortened to "Go'morn!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:27.42,Default-Alt,Leona,0,0,0,,Tension high socks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:30.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,"Time to eat" shortened to "Nom nom"!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:31.73,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:34.78,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,"Giant salamander" shortened to "Salagrander!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:35.73,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:38.10,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Take this seriously-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:40.92,Default-Alt,Mirei,0,0,0,,I'm pri'd off-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:40.92,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Sentence enders are poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:45.21,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Mirei's pri is especially poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:48.17,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Guess Mirei will have to come up with one-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:52.39,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Come on down, new natural sentence ender idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.78,0:05:55.81,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.27,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll say my natural sentence ender.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:06:00.23,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Hello-natu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:04.15,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Andou...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:06.61,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I hope you liked it-natu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:11.43,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,That's quite a splendid sentence ender-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.43,0:06:13.53,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Hooray for idols with sentence enders-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:15.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I also want a sentence ender!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:16.30,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.30,0:06:18.99,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop the cameras-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:19.67,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:20.45,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Natu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.45,0:06:23.00,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,The complaint hotline has been flooded-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:23.96,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:25.92,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Stop the sentence ender segment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:28.10,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,Fuwari has no need for a sentence ender!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:29.55,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,Mirei should pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.55,0:06:32.28,Default,Rand4,0,0,0,,I hate her "pri"! It gives me goosebumps!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.99,0:06:39.89,Default,Mega-nee1,0,0,0,,We are incredibly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:44.60,Default-Alt,Mega-nee2,0,0,0,,Please accept our apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:43.10,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,The lines are blowing up-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:44.60,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Put an end to it-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:46.11,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,E-Everyone, settle down-pr{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:50.07,Default-Alt,Chanko,0,0,0,,Please stay tuned-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.07,0:06:50.65,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.65,0:06:51.22,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:53.03,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,It was finally getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:54.09,Default,Rand4,0,0,0,,How disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.09,0:06:56.62,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ack! There's fewer people in line!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:57.58,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:06:58.61,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:07:01.29,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Next up is my special live drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.97,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Dorothy West's Special Drama...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:05.52,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,...starts now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:10.76,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'm Dorothy, the owner of a okonomiyaki restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:14.13,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,However, this is only my alter ego..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:15.09,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,But in reality...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:18.39,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, a situation has developed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.81,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:28.66,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Tension Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:30.63,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Pickled ginger is the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:32.13,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Your ninja ally,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:33.78,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Monja Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:35.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Help me, Monja Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:37.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,There's a suspicious individual over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:38.45,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.45,0:07:40.15,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'm an ally to ninjas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:41.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:43.08,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Monja Man, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:45.16,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Since you're a ninja, sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:51.88,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, I'm the mysterious Kurageera.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:54.38,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,The mysterious Kurageera has made her appearance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.38,0:07:56.38,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yes! Go get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.32,Default,Mega-nee-minijellys,0,0,0,,Pushuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:57.68,Default,Mega-nee-minijellys,0,0,0,,Pushuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:58.28,Default,Mega-nee-minijellys,0,0,0,,Pushuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:07:58.35,Default,Mega-nee-minijellys,0,0,0,,Pushuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:07:59.09,Default,Mega-nee-minijellys,0,0,0,,Pushuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.09,0:08:00.04,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:02.06,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Green laver beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:03.32,Default,Mega-nee-minijellys,0,0,0,,Pushuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.77,0:08:04.02,Default,Mega-nee-minijellys,0,0,0,,Pushuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:04.02,Default,Mega-nee-minijellys,0,0,0,,Pushuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:05.26,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Finishing move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:08.00,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Bonito Flakes Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:09.22,Default,Mega-nee-Announcer,0,0,0,,Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:15.03,Default,Mega-nee-Announcer,0,0,0,,Bonito Flakes Kick is taken from how it hurts to get hit by bonito flakes that haven't been shaven yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:16.49,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:18.57,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Red Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:22.03,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Sour!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:26.61,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:29.58,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Not until I conquer this planet...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:33.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Crap! Monja Man has gone to the dark side!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:39.50,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Stop this pointless story!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.80,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,You have to comply! There are broadcasting ethics!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:44.81,Default-Alt,Chanko,0,0,0,,Please stay tuned-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.57,0:08:48.27,Default,Laon,0,0,0,,Gloomy PriPara 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.61,0:08:50.47,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Here are our guests for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.47,0:08:52.02,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Alomageddon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:56.55,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Let us introduce to you the gloomiest part of PriPara Town!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:09:01.30,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I actually want to guide you to the 4th district of hell, but this will suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:05.28,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,This is an ever so gloomy spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:06.70,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Its name is UnderPri.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.89,0:09:09.54,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Hello and welcome-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:12.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wow, it's a super cozy bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:13.92,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It's peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.71,0:09:16.38,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What should I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:18.98,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I shall dine on the curry udon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.98,0:09:19.84,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:20.67,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.67,0:09:21.92,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Curry udon...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:24.61,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,If you make that into a 4-word idiom, it would be "I will follow along".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.61,0:09:25.64,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,So same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:27.64,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:29.31,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:30.52,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.51,0:09:38.36,Default,All,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:40.28,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:41.70,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Neat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:44.74,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This polka dot curry pattern is cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:48.36,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:50.46,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Everyone can do the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:51.71,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I was ill prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:53.17,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,See you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.02,0:09:58.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It seems like there are even fewer than earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:01.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,If it continues like this, we might not get to snap with one million people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:05.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,And this is on top of the flood of weird complaints that were phoned in-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:06.71,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:07.54,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:09.35,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's time to head to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:11.12,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please make your way to the sleepover room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:11.85,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.85,0:10:13.99,Default,Mege-nee,0,0,0,,Good girls mustn't stay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.99,0:10:16.76,Default,Mege-nee,0,0,0,,To put it simply, it's the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:18.63,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Don't worry-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:18.63,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Don't worry-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:21.40,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Leave the late night programming to us-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.40,0:10:25.91,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,We'll get the crowd brimming with laughter and completely capture their hearts-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:27.01,Default,All,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:28.79,Default,All,0,0,0,,Will you really be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:31.25,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Just look forward to coming back in the morning-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:31.25,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Just look forward to coming back in the morning-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.86,0:10:34.43,Default,All,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:39.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,500,000th Friend Ticket exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.67,0:10:48.60,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,500,001st, 500,002nd, 500,003rd, 500,004th...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:55.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,1,000,000,002,840th, 1,000,000,002,841st...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:56.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:58.48,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I passed one million?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.32,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Lala, you didn't fall asleep-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:02.95,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Cock-a-doodle-doo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.42,0:11:08.16,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Oh no! PriPara TV's viewership has plummeted!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:11.04,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That means there's only 10 people watching in the entire world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:13.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:26.93,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,There's not a single fan in the venue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:28.83,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,How sallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:29.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:30.68,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:32.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What the heck, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:34.39,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Your segment must have been worthless-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:37.02,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Of course it wasn't-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:39.15,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,We recorded it, so you can look for yourselves-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:42.96,Default,Gay,0,0,0,,The Love of Kuma and Usagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:47.17,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I was once acquainted with this guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:49.75,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,but when I spilled carrot juice on the floor, he called it a waste,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:52.03,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,and licked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:53.33,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,How disgusting-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:54.80,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:56.85,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,There was this guy I was once acquainted with,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.85,0:12:00.41,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,but he would drink too much veggie juice before bed and end up wetting the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:01.71,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It was hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:02.53,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:04.64,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,How dare you reveal that secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:06.11,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You started it-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:07.86,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,What's with this poor mascot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.86,0:12:09.76,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Shut it, you sleezeball!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:13.22,Default-Alt,Chanko,0,0,0,,Please stay tuned-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:15.28,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,The Toriko-sama of Entertainment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.53,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I am the Toriko of Misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:22.63,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,I thought that was a stalk sticking up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:24.90,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,but it was really a long nail-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:28.36,Default-Alt,Chanko,0,0,0,,Please stay tuned-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:31.56,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Gloria Blows the Competition Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:32.46,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:33.28,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:34.37,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.37,0:12:36.33,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Guroro, guro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,Rina,0,0,0,,{Pakyuu!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:39.98,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You lost once again, Rina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:42.75,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do it again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.75,0:12:46.24,Default-Alt,Chanko,0,0,0,,Please stay tuned-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:47.86,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:50.68,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,We covered all the bases of late night TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:50.68,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:53.71,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,How is that the pinnacle of late night TV, you incompetent mascots?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:54.64,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:54.64,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pa pi pu pe po!{I'm not 100%; but I think this is a parody of https//www.youtube.com/watch?v=BCLxwtHWJng}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:12:59.99,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have gone to bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.99,0:13:03.48,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,With the way things are going, our snapping Friend Tickets with one million people is in a perilous situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:05.57,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,We just have to regain our power-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Houjou Sophie's Heartfelt Communication!{parody of http//www.ntv.co.jp/omo-tv/}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll open communication with an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring... ring...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:16.95,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Leona West's Daily Weather Forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:19.99,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Today's weather... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.99,0:13:21.85,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I think it'll be clear out,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.85,0:13:23.79,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,but there's a chance of rain or snow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.79,0:13:26.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Lala's Super Magic Show!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:29.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll escape from this in an instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:30.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:32.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.53,0:13:33.76,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:36.72,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Our ratings keep sliding-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.19,0:13:39.23,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,There's only one more watching-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:45.19,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,If your viewership drops to zero, "24.5 Hour Television" will be taken off the air at that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:46.65,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:46.65,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:48.00,Default,All,0,0,0,,Taken off the air?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:50.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Even though we've only gathered this many Friend Tickets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.36,0:13:52.57,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,That's totally uncool-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.57,0:13:56.33,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,It's your fault that this started to happen from the very beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:57.51,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,No it's not-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.51,0:14:00.04,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It's because your drama was so boring, Dorothy-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:03.50,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That's because Sophie didn't do her job correctly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:06.50,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Don't push the blame on our Sophie-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:08.39,Default,3,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:10.47,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:16.68,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,If we stick kelp up in the place of Friend Tickets, it might just work out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:16.68,Default-Alt,Mirothy,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:19.46,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,How about mochi wrapped in oak leaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.89,0:14:22.42,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,This shall turn the tables!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.42,0:14:24.46,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'll cover the spaces!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:25.86,Default,Pands,0,0,0,,Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:30.78,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'm just going to destroy the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:34.74,Default-Alt,Leona,0,0,0,,Ack! Don't do that, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:34.74,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,They're out of control already-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.97,0:14:38.70,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And this is the what remains of that so called friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:43.42,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,There must be something wrong with me for being the last one watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:47.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,This isn't the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.83,0:14:49.38,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I don't want it to end!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:50.84,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Lala...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:55.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I mean, I haven't become one with all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.30,0:14:57.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I want to keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:14:58.88,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Even if our programme gets cancelled,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:01.77,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,let's continue until our hearts are united...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.77,0:15:05.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,...and until this wall becomes filled with Friend Tickets!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:07.94,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Lala...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.33,0:15:10.44,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,It might take time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.44,0:15:12.40,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,but let's do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:15.59,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:17.78,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Lala, you're a moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:20.33,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Make up your mind on either a good story or being stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.33,0:15:23.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh? Did I mess up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:27.14,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,But it's just as Lala said-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:27.85,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.85,0:15:33.05,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,The programme's probably not going well because our hearts aren't united.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.05,0:15:36.85,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I suppose if the six of us are disconnected we won't be able to snap with one million people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:37.64,Default,Soona,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:39.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.10,0:15:42.33,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,That means even if we get complaints, we won't worry about them-pri-pri-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:43.56,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I'll pri without a care-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:46.30,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Let us help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:49.51,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Only we know of the exit from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:52.50,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma said she'll also lend her help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:53.53,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,You didn't have to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:56.14,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,The demon has turned red.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.14,0:15:57.49,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'm just cheering you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:15:58.99,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:02.41,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Falulu will help too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.41,0:16:03.87,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:04.91,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.91,0:16:06.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,With our friendship power,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:08.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,let's put on an energising concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:09.08,Default,Rest,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:13.05,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,And I've prepared the pre-pre-prettiest coord for it-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:14.51,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:21.81,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:24.68,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:28.75,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:36.45,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The preparations that Mirei-chan made include a new colour for the superior poppin' clown series.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.45,0:16:39.35,Default,Laon,0,0,0,,Baby Pink Clown Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:40.45,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:47.37,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The tops and skirts are completely covered in spangles making it glitter and sparkle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:49.54,Default,Mirothy,0,0,0,,Banana Yellow Clown Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:50.46,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:51.21,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.93,0:16:55.46,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Everyone loves the polka dots and stripes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.46,0:16:58.24,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,A greedy coord packed with lots of both.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:17:00.79,Default,Soona,0,0,0,,French Lime Clown Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.93,0:17:07.64,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Oh? Is that SoLaMi Dressing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:09.54,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,They're singing "Realize!"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:10.85,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:12.72,Default,Rand4,0,0,0,,I love that song!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:28.89,Default,,0,0,55,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.67,0:18:52.36,Default,All,0,0,0,,Speeding into the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:54.67,Default,All,0,0,0,,We are PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:07.01,Default,Usagi,0,180,0,,Our viewers are back-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:07.01,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,Our viewers are back-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:11.03,Default,SoLaMiDressing,0,100,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:06.91,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,One million!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:11.33,Default,All,0,0,0,,Complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.22,0:20:15.02,Default,All,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:17.25,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:19.90,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Just like I said in the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:23.46,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,if you snap with one million people, the Friend Tickets will create a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:25.40,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,So without further ado,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.40,0:20:27.93,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,let's miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.89,0:20:33.35,Default,All,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.89,0:20:37.00,Default,All,0,0,0,,When it seems like the connection with your friends is falling apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:39.28,Default,All,0,0,0,,please remember my smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:42.45,Default,All,0,0,0,,If you do that, I'm sure a wonderful feeling will wash over you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:44.46,Default,All,0,0,0,,and your hearts will become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:47.32,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,This was the miracle...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:50.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll also create a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:51.03,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:55.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll do the knock over ten million Friend Ticket domino challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:56.75,Default,Mirothy,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.75,0:20:57.99,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:21:00.33,Default,Others,0,0,0,,See you next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.33,0:21:01.71,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:09.13,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,One thing has been made clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:12.15,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Manaka Lala...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:13.97,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This one's the dumbest of all!
Dialogue: 3,0:21:14.46,0:21:16.86,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,A complete idiot!
Dialogue: 3,0:21:16.86,0:21:20.69,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,In the end, I wasn't able to find the next princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.69,0:21:22.74,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,No bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.74,0:21:24.98,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,There's no need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.35,0:21:33.63,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,I must deliver these feelings... to President Minami!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:01.52,Default,Amamiya,0,0,0,,Pri...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,Who,0,0,0,,{niyahaha}

